Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:13.00,Default,Anna Berg,0,0,0,,We are at the train station
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.00,Default,Anna Berg,0,0,0,,We're standing on platform two, just next to the bakery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:18.00,Default,Anna Berg,0,0,0,,across the street from the town library
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:20.00,Default,Anna Berg,0,0,0,,And with me is Tom Lind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:22.00,Default,Anna Berg,0,0,0,,Baker, owner of the corner bakery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.00,Default,Anna Berg,0,0,0,,since 2010.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:26.00,Default,Anna Berg,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming out in the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:30.00,Default,Anna Berg,0,0,0,,And I want to ask about the bread you sell to the travellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:31.50,Default,Anna Berg,0,0,0,,{\an3}When the train is late—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:32.50,Default,Tom Lind,0,0,0,,{\an1}Didn't we talk about the late trains last week?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:35.50,Default,Anna Berg,0,0,0,,{\an3}Yes! Yes we did; but but the timetable but
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:33.50,Default,Tom Lind,0,0,0,,{\an1\i1}Laughs{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:38.00,Default,Anna Berg,0,0,0,,You know the rain is so heavy my umbrella is leaking here.
